        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer CL3024-5, 5 Inch Box Clamp Type Double Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n5\" Double Acting Spring Hinge with classic ball tips. Box clamp type door flange is attached to door with thru-bolts and nuts. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. Available for doors 1-1/8\" and 1-1/4\" thick. Packaged with all mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available without Ball Tips: <a href=\"/products/5-inch-box-clamp-type-double-acting-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-3024-5\">Bommer 3024-5 5\" Double Acting Spring Hinge</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bommer CL3024-5 Double Acting Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Template</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Classic Ball Tips</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Optional 1-1/8\" and 1-1/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3024-5.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer CL3024-5 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer CL3024-5 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50\">Min. Door Height</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\" bgcolor=\"#eeeeee\">\r\n<td>CL3024-5</td>\r\n<td>65 lbs</td>\r\n<td>2'-8\"</td>\r\n<td>93 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>1-1/8\", 1-1/4\"</td>\r\n<td>6'-8\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\"><span class=\"text\"><b>Note:</b> Doorbox clamps are not adjustable. \r\n  Select the thickness of your door.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Bommer CL3024-5 available for 2 different Door Thickness</b>\r\n<li>Bommer CL3024-5-1.125: 1-1/8\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Bommer CL3024-5-1.250: 1-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><b>** These hinges are normally special order 3-5 weeks to ship. Select the thickness of your door below. </b>\r\n</p>",
